{"step_index":282,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-19T06:28:59Z","content":"Also simplify the boot scripts since packages are now pre-extracted (no mounting needed):","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Simplify bootsync since all packages are pre-extracted into rootfs — no squashfs mounting needed at runtime.","EndLine":310,"Instruction":"Simplify bootsync.sh since binaries are already in rootfs","ReplacementContent":"bootsync_sh = \"\"\"#!/bin/sh\nmkdir -p /lib64\nln -sf /lib/* /lib64/ 2>/dev/null || true\nldconfig 2>/dev/null || true\nmdev -s 2>/dev/null || true\nifconfig lo 127.0.0.1 up\nfor iface in $(ls /sys/class/net/ 2>/dev/null); do\n    [ \"$iface\" = \"lo\" ] && continue\n    ifconfig \"$iface\" up 2>/dev/null || true\n    udhcpc -b -i \"$iface\" 2>/dev/null || true\ndone\necho Xorg > /etc/sysconfig/Xserver\necho jwm > /etc/sysconfig/desktop\n\"\"\"\nadd_text('opt/bootsync.sh', bootsync_sh, 0o100755)\n\nbootlocal_sh = \"\"\"#!/bin/sh\nmkdir -p /lib64\nln -sf /lib/* /lib64/ 2>/dev/null || true\nldconfig 2>/dev/null || true\n\nexport PORT=8080\n/usr/local/bin/node /opt/endroid/server/index.js > /var/log/endroid.log 2>&1 &\n\nmkdir -p /home/tc\ncat > /home/tc/.xinitrc << 'XIEOF'\n#!/bin/sh\nxsetroot -solid '#1a1a2e'\ndillo http://127.0.0.1:8080/ &\njwm\nXIEOF\nchmod +x /home/tc/.xinitrc\nchown -R tc:staff /home/tc 2>/dev/null || true\n\nsleep 2\nsu - tc -c 'xinit /home/tc/.xinitrc -- :0 vt7 -ac' > /tmp/xorg.log 2>&1 &\n\"\"\"\nadd_text('opt/bootlocal.sh', bootlocal_sh, 0o100755)","StartLine":217,"TargetContent":"bootsync_sh = \"\"\"#!/bin/sh\n# Endroid OS Bare-Metal Bootsync\n\necho \"========================================================\"\necho \"  Starting Endroid OS Standalone Bare-Metal Runtime\"\necho \"========================================================\"\n\nmkdir -p /lib64\nln -sf /lib/* /lib64/ 2>/dev/null || true\nmdev -s 2>/dev/null || true\n\nifconfig lo 127.0.0.1 up\nfor iface in $(ls /sys/class/net/ 2>/dev/null); do\n    [ \"$iface\" = \"lo\" ] && continue\n    ifconfig \"$iface\" up 2>/dev/null || true\n    udhcpc -b -i \"$iface\" 2>/dev/null || true\ndone\n\n# Setup TCEDIR\nmkdir -p /tmp/tce/optional /etc/sysconfig\nrm -f /etc/sysconfig/tcedir\nln -s /tmp/tce /etc/sysconfig/tcedir\necho Xorg > /etc/sysconfig/Xserver\necho jwm > /etc/sysconfig/desktop\n\n# Copy embedded packages\n[ -d /opt/tce/optional ] && cp /opt/tce/optional/*.tcz /tmp/tce/optional/ 2>/dev/null || true\n\n# Mount CD-ROM and copy packages\nmkdir -p /mnt/sr0\nfor dev in /dev/sr0 /dev/sr1 /dev/cdrom /dev/hdc; do\n    mount -r $dev /mnt/sr0 2>/dev/null && break\ndone\nfor d in /mnt/sr0/cce/optional /mnt/sr0/tce/optional; do\n    [ -d \"$d\" ] && cp \"$d\"/*.tcz /tmp/tce/optional/ 2>/dev/null || true\ndone\n\n# Mount all .tcz squashfs packages directly into filesystem\nmkdir -p /usr/local/tce.installed\nfor pkg in /tmp/tce/optional/*.tcz; do\n    [ -f \"$pkg\" ] || continue\n    name=$(basename \"$pkg\" .tcz)\n    mnt=\"/usr/local/tce.installed/$name\"\n    mkdir -p \"$mnt\"\n    mount -t squashfs -o loop,ro \"$pkg\" \"$mnt\" 2>/dev/null || continue\n    # Overlay into root filesystem\n    (cd \"$mnt\" && find . -not -type d | cpio -p --quiet / 2>/dev/null) || true\ndone\nldconfig 2>/dev/null || true\n\"\"\"\nadd_text('opt/bootsync.sh', bootsync_sh, 0o100755)\n\nbootlocal_sh = \"\"\"#!/bin/sh\n# Endroid OS bootlocal\n\nmkdir -p /lib64\nln -sf /lib/* /lib64/ 2>/dev/null || true\nldconfig 2>/dev/null || true\n\n# Start Node.js server\nexport PORT=8080\n/usr/local/bin/node /opt/endroid/server/index.js > /var/log/endroid.log 2>&1 &\n\n# Write user xinitrc\nmkdir -p /home/tc\ncat > /home/tc/.xinitrc << 'XIEOF'\n#!/bin/sh\nxsetroot -solid '#1a1a2e'\ndillo http://127.0.0.1:8080/ &\njwm\nXIEOF\nchmod +x /home/tc/.xinitrc\nchown -R tc:staff /home/tc 2>/dev/null || true\n\n# Launch X\nsleep 2\nXBIN=$(which Xorg 2>/dev/null || which X 2>/dev/null || which Xvesa 2>/dev/null || echo \"\")\nif [ -n \"$XBIN\" ]; then\n    su - tc -c 'xinit /home/tc/.xinitrc -- :0 vt7 -ac' > /tmp/xorg.log 2>&1 &\nfi\n\"\"\"\nadd_text('opt/bootlocal.sh', bootlocal_sh, 0o100755)","TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\Bullettemporary\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\dump-garbage\\iso-builder\\build_real_iso.py","toolAction":"Simplifying boot scripts for pre-extracted rootfs","toolSummary":"Simplify boot scripts"}}]}
