{"step_index":339,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-19T06:37:54Z","content":"Also fix bootlocal to embed a working Xorg.conf and use `Xvesa` fallback:","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Add embedded Xorg.conf for VESA driver and fallback to Xvesa so X starts correctly in QEMU","EndLine":295,"Instruction":"Fix bootlocal to embed Xorg.conf and fallback X startup","ReplacementContent":"bootlocal_sh = \"\"\"#!/bin/sh\nmkdir -p /lib64\nln -sf /lib/* /lib64/ 2>/dev/null || true\nldconfig 2>/dev/null || true\n\nexport PORT=8080\n/usr/local/bin/node /opt/endroid/server/index.js > /var/log/endroid.log 2>&1 &\n\n# Write Xorg config for VESA (works in QEMU/VirtualBox)\nmkdir -p /etc/X11\ncat > /etc/X11/xorg.conf << 'XEOF'\nSection \"Device\"\n  Identifier \"Card0\"\n  Driver \"vesa\"\nEndSection\nSection \"Screen\"\n  Identifier \"Screen0\"\n  Device \"Card0\"\n  DefaultDepth 16\nEndSection\nSection \"ServerFlags\"\n  Option \"AllowMouseOpenFail\" \"true\"\n  Option \"AutoAddDevices\" \"false\"\nEndSection\nXEOF\n\nmkdir -p /home/tc\ncat > /home/tc/.xinitrc << 'XIEOF'\n#!/bin/sh\nxsetroot -solid '#1a1a2e'\ndillo http://127.0.0.1:8080/ &\nexec jwm\nXIEOF\nchmod +x /home/tc/.xinitrc\nchown -R tc:staff /home/tc 2>/dev/null || true\n\nsleep 2\nsu - tc -c 'xinit /home/tc/.xinitrc -- :0 -ac vt7 2>/tmp/x.log' &\n\"\"\"\nadd_text('opt/bootlocal.sh', bootlocal_sh, 0o100755)","StartLine":267,"TargetContent":"bootlocal_sh = \"\"\"#!/bin/sh\nmkdir -p /lib64\nln -sf /lib/* /lib64/ 2>/dev/null || true\nldconfig 2>/dev/null || true\n\nexport PORT=8080\n/usr/local/bin/node /opt/endroid/server/index.js > /var/log/endroid.log 2>&1 &\n\nmkdir -p /home/tc\ncat > /home/tc/.xinitrc << 'XIEOF'\n#!/bin/sh\nxsetroot -solid '#1a1a2e'\ndillo http://127.0.0.1:8080/ &\njwm\nXIEOF\nchmod +x /home/tc/.xinitrc\nchown -R tc:staff /home/tc 2>/dev/null || true\n\nsleep 2\nsu - tc -c 'xinit /home/tc/.xinitrc -- :0 vt7 -ac' > /tmp/xorg.log 2>&1 &\n\"\"\"\nadd_text('opt/bootlocal.sh', bootlocal_sh, 0o100755)","TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\Bullettemporary\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\dump-garbage\\iso-builder\\build_real_iso.py","toolAction":"Fixing bootlocal with Xorg.conf","toolSummary":"Fix bootlocal Xorg config"}}]}
